                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd9e89ee-e402-3023-ad94-525df9ccce53",
                        "entry_id": "d3027e43-1080-31db-8a63-989d6849005f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "небольшой кинжал с тонким острым трёх-, четырёхгранным или ромбовидным клинком"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5e359a5-cc20-4a84-8b0d-5322cbe9208e",
                                "sense_id": "cd9e89ee-e402-3023-ad94-525df9ccce53",
                                "text": "За поясом у него заткнуты были пара пистолетов в богатой оправе и короткий итальянский стилет, то есть трёхгранный кинжал."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "417fa670-7f03-48b6-8068-f9bf18ca601b",
                                "sense_id": "cd9e89ee-e402-3023-ad94-525df9ccce53",
                                "text": "В бархатном футляре лежало что-то вроде узкого стилета с затейливой резьбой и ручкой из слоновой кости."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1da9d28f-2e35-432a-9ff4-49289cab500d",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3027e43-1080-31db-8a63-989d6849005f",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd9e89ee-e402-3023-ad94-525df9ccce53",
                        "target_lang_word": "stiletto",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stiletto",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdda839b-2c65-3b9f-9895-23ea8d33bc61",
                                        "entry_id": "a0f9774f-139a-3c2b-9710-7d98c12a750c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small, slender knife or dagger-like weapon intended for stabbing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b2abd5a-e7e0-4b5b-833f-165d88c8cdbb",
                                                "sense_id": "fdda839b-2c65-3b9f-9895-23ea8d33bc61",
                                                "text": "There the cause of death was soon ascertained; the victim of this daring outrage had been stabbed to death from ear to ear with a long, sharp instrument, in shape like an antique stiletto, which, I may tell you, was subsequently found under the cushions of the hansom."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f137eea8-4960-3280-b28b-90e392ed3fa5",
                                        "entry_id": "a0f9774f-139a-3c2b-9710-7d98c12a750c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rapier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00bdfabc-fc12-351c-a757-ffb25d8df16b",
                                        "entry_id": "a0f9774f-139a-3c2b-9710-7d98c12a750c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An awl."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df672dd5-56df-3cef-be7e-f4768919f214",
                                        "entry_id": "a0f9774f-139a-3c2b-9710-7d98c12a750c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woman's shoe with a tall, slender heel (called a stiletto heel)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd41dbd4-143b-3529-9e5b-220ee313f873",
                                        "entry_id": "a0f9774f-139a-3c2b-9710-7d98c12a750c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A beard trimmed into a pointed form."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efa55d2c-4166-472a-9e60-073b8cba52a4",
                                                "sense_id": "dd41dbd4-143b-3529-9e5b-220ee313f873",
                                                "text": "The very quaik of faſhions, the very hee that / VVeares a Steletto on his chinne."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "stiletto",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb69d226-2cd4-37f3-acab-57ac5c59d1b6",
                                        "entry_id": "91b8a9f2-aa87-3a7a-93d8-01904399cf4a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To attack or kill with a stiletto (dagger)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff8c9221-a653-4c8e-9735-8eddaf365fa1",
                                                "sense_id": "fb69d226-2cd4-37f3-acab-57ac5c59d1b6",
                                                "text": "The recollection of former atrocities by the populace in plundering the city and stilettoing the inhabitants, is sufficiently fresh in the remembrance of the government to serve as an additional stimulus to prevent similar disorders."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
